# Contract results are per-machine observation, not repo content: each machine
# runs the suite against whatever Claude Code build it happens to be on, and
# agent-rig is deployed to several. Committing them would conflict on every
# pull for no gain. hooks/internals-drift.sh degrades to a plain version
# comparison when the file is absent, which is what a fresh clone should see.
docs/contract-results.tsv
